Quantum-Practices
=================

Quantum-Practices is based on and adapted from the public GitHub project:

  UnitaryLab Quantum Skills
  https://github.com/unitarylab/quantum-skills
  Skill corpus synchronized from upstream commit:
  2ad300222b6578fbb8c2a6ff648f709108cbff63

The upstream project provides the quantum algorithm guide corpus that this
repository adapts into a DeepSeek Harness tool bundle.
This repository adds the DSH Profile Bundle package shape, Cordis tool
registration, generated read-only practice catalog, package verification,
security tests, Workshop manifest, and release documentation.

Only public GitHub upstream skill content is used as the source corpus.

